  "保留 New 系列性能，取消裸眼 3D。": "Retaining the performance of the New series and removing glasses-free 3D.",
  "保留初代的区域探索、未来视和三人战斗，以任务导航、外观装备、休闲模式与专家模式降低旧版摩擦；完成主线后可进入以梅莉亚为中心的独立后日谈。": "Retaining the original game features of area exploration, Vision, and three-player combat, while reducing friction in the old version through quest navigation, cosmetic equipment, casual mode, and expert mode; After completing the main storyline, you can enter an independent post-story centered on Merlia.",
  "保留关都关卡节奏，用第三世代的特性、性格和招式池重算队伍价值；七之岛同时承担战后内容与跨世代图鉴连接器。": "Maintain the pace of each stage, and use the Ability, Nature, and Move banners from Gen 3 to recalculate team value; Seven Islands also handles postwar content and cross-generation Pokédex connectors.",
  "保留跨越城都、关都的后日谈结构，并用雪拉比事件补写坂木与火箭队广播之间的缺席因果，让重制版以可选事件修补旧作人物线。": "It retains the epilogue structure spanning Johto and Kanto, and uses the Shelabi incident to supplement the cause and effect of Sakaki's absence from Team Rocket's broadcast, allowing the remake version to patch up the original character lines with optional events.",
  "保留神奥地图和流程骨架，但以地下大洞窟、亲密度收益和现代学习招式改写队伍获取与养成节奏。": "It retains the Sinnoh map and flow framework, but relies on underground caves, intimacy rewards, and modern learning moves to rewrite team acquisition and progression tempo.",
  "保留双主角、多风格、现金成长与经营支线，并新增多人在线 Red Light Raid，让玩家从系列角色中选人共同清场。": "It retains dual protagonists, multiple styles, cash growth, and management side content, and adds a multiplayer online Red Light Raid, allowing players to select characters from the series to clear the field together.",
  "寶可夢 水晶": "Pokémon Crystal",
