  "超级街头霸王II X 绝世高人": "Super Street Fighter II X Peerless Master",
  "超级进化要求携带专属石且一场只能触发一次，以占用道具位换取临场爆发；妖精属性同时重配既有克制表。学习装置从单体携带道具改成全队经验开关，宝可梦友伴则把抚摸、小游戏与战斗奖励连接起来；系统主动降低整队养成成本，为更频繁的队伍试用服务。": "Mega Evolution requires carrying an exclusive stone that can only be triggered once per game, allowing you to use item slots to exchange for an on-the-spot burst; Fairy type re-equips existing resistance tables. The learning device changed from carrying items to a team-wide experience switch, while Pokémon companions linked petting, mini-games, and battle rewards; The system proactively lowers the overall team progression cost, serving more frequent team trials.",
