  "翻页绘本和触控笔输入。": "Flip the picture book and input with the stylus.",
  "反抗组织回归者对抗加斯特拉帝国与凯夫卡。凯夫卡夺取三斗神力量、毁灭世界后，分散的伙伴重新集结，最终在崩坏世界中击败他。": "The rebel group Returnees confronts the Gastra Empire against Kefka. After Kefka seized the power of the Three Fighting Gods and destroyed the world, his scattered companions regrouped and ultimately defeated him in the Honkai world.",
  "反重力赛车2048": "Anti-gravity car 2048",
  "方向盘控制。": "Steering wheel controls.",
  "方向盘扩展": "Extended steering wheel",
  "芳川树继续阅读由不同推理作家设计的案件，在冥界审判中完成余下挑战并追索自己身亡的真相。": "Yoshikawa Shu continues reading cases designed by different mystery writers, completing the remaining challenges and uncovering the truth behind his death during the Underworld trial.",
  "房间判定、蓝图和居民职业形成自动生产链；主岛长期保留建设，素材岛提供无限基础资源。玩家由亲手摆每块方块逐步转向设计可由居民执行的系统。": "Room assessment, blueprints, and resident jobs form an automated production chain; The main island has been preserved for a long time, and the material island provides unlimited basic resources. Players gradually move from placing each block by hand to designing systems that residents can execute.",
  "放贷人秋山骏、逃犯冴岛大河、警员谷村正义和桐生因二十五年前的上野吉春袭击事件相继卷入神室町阴谋。四人的信息最终拼合出警界、黑道和失踪资金之间的真相。": "Lender Shun Akiyama, fugitive Taiga Saejima, police officer Masayoshi Tanimura, and Kiryu are all drawn into the Kamurocho conspiracy due to the attack on Yoshiharu Ueno twenty-five years ago. The information about the four ultimately pieces together the truth behind the police, the underworld, and the missing funds.",
  "飞艇失事后在孤岛侦察怪物，以体型占位和技能继承组队，探索区域并参加怪物大赛。": "After the airship crashes, scout monsters on the isolated island, team up based on size and skill inheritance, explore areas, and participate in monster tournaments.",
  "非独立游戏平台。": "Non-independent gaming platforms.",
  "飛天幽夢": "A dreamlike soaring through the sky",
  "飛行俱樂部 度假勝地": "Flying Club Resort Destination",
  "飛行俱樂部64": "Flying Club 64",
  "菲因王国被帕拉梅奇亚帝国毁灭后，弗利欧尼尔等孤儿加入反抗军，在战争、牺牲与失去中推翻皇帝。": "After the Kingdom of Finin was destroyed by the Paramechia Empire, orphans like Frionil joined the rebel forces, overthrowing the emperor amid war, sacrifice, and loss.",
  "分别比较一代单角色和二代三人队新增技能是否破坏原本资源压力，并追踪新增故事怎样连接《III》重制。": "Compare whether the new skills for single-character teams in the first and second generations of three disrupt the original resource pressure, and track how the new story connects to the III remake.",
  "分别操控瑞希与龙木调查跨越六年的半身连续杀人，在现实搜证与 Somnium 分支间重组时间。": "He manipulates Mizuki and Ryuki to investigate a six-year serial murder involving a half-body murder, gathering evidence in reality and reorganizing the Somnium branch timeline.",
  "分别记录第二幕的牺牲结果与第三幕被改写的结果，判断回溯何时提供补完，何时削弱已发生的角色成长。": "It records the sacrifice results of Act Two and the rewritten Act, determining when retrospectives provide supplements and when to weaken character growth.",
  "分叉 · 密室与多周目": "Fork · The secret chamber was filled with many rounds of observation",
  "分叉 · 真人群像": "Fork · Live-action ensemble cast",
  "分季发行把未解决案件和解答跨产品拆分，使玩家等待、讨论与验证假说也成为作品体验的一部分。": "Seasonal releases split unsolved cases and solutions across products, making waiting, discussing, and validating hypotheses part of the game experience.",
  "分离手柄并提供 AV 输出。": "Detachable handle and AV output provided.",
  "分析旋律重音与输入谱面是否对应玩家记忆中的战斗和场景，而非只提高音符密度。": "Analyze whether melodic accent and input charts correspond to the battles and scenes in players' memories, rather than just increasing note density.",
  "分析长篇系列如何用低烈度日常建立角色失去之物，再让政治危机获得具体情感代价。": "Analyzing how the long-form series uses low-intensity daily life to build on what characters have lost, then gives political crises concrete emotional consequences.",
  "分析侦察率由攻击力、强化和敌方状态构成的公式，判断它如何让“捕捉”也使用战斗构筑。": "Analyze the formula for scout rate, which is composed of attack power, enhancement, and enemy status, and judge how it allows \"Capture\" to also use combat constructs.",
  "分支继续复用角色与地点，但镜头、声音定位和实时特效直接控制信息出现的时机；选择主要决定玩家接触哪组幻觉、实验线索和死亡路径，而非完成严格的犯人推理。": "Branches continue to reuse characters and locations, but shots, sound positioning, and real-time effects directly control the timing of information appearance; Choices mainly determine which sets of hallucinations, experimental clues, and death paths the player encounters, rather than completing rigorous criminal deductions.",
  "服务型": "Service-oriented",
  "服务型 · 卡牌 RPG": "Service-oriented · cards RPG",
  "父子双主角让同一迷宫世界呈现装备型与怪物指挥型两种身份，但故事仍主要服务系统切换。": "The father and son dual protagonists present both equipment and monster command roles in the same labyrinth world, but the story mainly serves system switching.",
  "附带六键手柄的最后期型号。": "The last model comes with a six-key controller.",
  "附加篇不改写原作主线，而用另一名角色的短篇回收前传新增的情感债，使跨时代重制形成双向连接。": "The extras don't rewrite the original storyline, but instead use another character's short story to recover the emotional debts added by Prequel, creating a two-way connection in the era-crossing remake.",
  "复盘每回合预测正确与否，检查有限单位和地图尺寸怎样制造可读的心理博弈。": "Review each round's predictions for accuracy, and check how limited units and map sizes create readable psychological games.",
  "复用合众地图但以两年时间差、更换起点和开放旧物种改变路线；记忆连接把前作存档转为人物事件。栖息地列表会明确提示当前区域是否收齐，世界锦标赛则把历代馆主转换成多套规则赛；作品用信息工具和跨代首领资产支撑“同一地区的续作”，而不是再做一张增强版。": "Reusing United maps but with a two-year interval, changing starting points, and reopening old species routes; Memory Connect converted the previous game's save into character events. The habitat list clearly indicates whether the current area is complete, and the World Championship converts past pavilion owners into multiple set of rules tournaments; The work supports the \"sequel of the same region\" with information tools and cross-generational leaders' assets, rather than making an enhanced version.",
  "复杂控制器与体育游戏是主要差异": "Complex controllers are the main difference from sports games",
