  "怪兽战斗之路 · 卡牌街机": "Monster Battle Road · Arcade cards",
  "怪物按自身 AI 和行动间隔作战，玩家拖动单位躲避范围、接近目标或调整阵线；队伍重量限制高阶怪物同时上场。决策集中在战前编队与战中位置干预。": "Monsters fight according to their AI and action intervals; players drag units to evade range, approach targets, or adjust their battle lines; Team weight limits high-tier monsters to enter the field simultaneously. Decision-making focused on pre-war party building and mid-war positional intervention.",
  "怪物的 Fortes 决定滑翔、弹跳、潜行等移动方式，宝物罗盘和队员视野逐步缩小位置；携带宝藏会增加回程风险。探索队伍的价值不只来自战斗数值。": "The monster's Fortes determine movement modes such as gliding, bouncing, and stealth, while the treasure compass and team members' vision gradually shrinks in position; Carrying treasure increases the risk of returning. The value of an exploration team comes not only from combat stats.",
  "怪物卡、装备卡和职业共同决定队伍，必杀仍依赖组合与时机；持续卡池扩大了联动表，也提高信息门槛。": "Monster cards, equipment cards, and jobs together determine the team, while finishers still depend on combination and timing; The continuous pool has expanded the linked table and raised the information threshold.",
  "怪物可被收服并承担战斗、骑乘或合体功能，队伍规模和通道宽度限制同时存在。玩家要在保留稀有伙伴、当前迷宫解法和死亡风险之间取舍。": "Monsters can be tamed and take on combat, mounting, or combination functions, with team size and channel width restrictions coexisting. Players must choose between keeping rare companions, current maze solutions, and the risk of death.",
  "怪物猎人4": "Monster Hunter 4",
  "怪物通过转生提高阶级并继承技能，关卡资源和抽取决定可用池；短战斗保留指令与队伍属性。长期目标由版本新增怪物和活动规则持续移动。": "Monsters increase their rank and inherit skills through reincarnation, while level resources and gacha determine the available pool; Short battles retain commands and team types. Long-term objectives are continuously moved by monsters added in the version and event rules.",
  "观察类型实验何时能借角色与场景资产创造新鲜感，何时会因为操作基础与系列优势不匹配而削弱体验。": "Observe when type experiments can create novelty through characters and scene assets, and when the experience is weakened by mismatches between gameplay fundamentals and the series' strengths.",
  "观察同一冲撞动作如何兼任移动、攻击、解谜和救援，减少掌机动作游戏的输入负担。": "Watch how the same collision action can simultaneously serve as movement, attack, puzzle-solving, and rescue, reducing the input load of handheld action games.",
  "观察续作如何复用核心城市，同时用新城市和新势力扩大叙事尺度，避免简单重复首作阴谋。": "Watch how Sequel reuses core cities while expanding narrative scale with new cities and new forces, avoiding simply repeating the plots of the original game.",
  "光明與黑暗續戰篇II 古代的封印": "Light and Darkness Continued War II: Ancient Seals",
  "光驱版": "Optical drive version",
  "光神话 帕尔提娜之镜": "Light Myth Mirror of the Partina",
  "光与暗两队分别推进章节并解锁职业，职业 AP 学习能力后可跨职配置；最终再汇合队伍。它以分队叙事控制职业开放顺序，让同一套经典职业系统在两条成长路线中形成不同组合。": "The Light and Dark teams advance chapters separately and unlock job AP learning abilities, allowing cross-class configuration; Finally, they regrouped again. It uses team narrative to control the order of job openings, allowing the same classic job system to form different combinations across two growth paths.",
  "光之战士与暗之战士在被分裂的世界中旅行，恢复水晶与元素平衡，并对抗试图吞噬世界的黑暗。": "Warriors of Light and Darkness travel through a divided world, restore crystal and elemental balance, and fight against the darkness that seeks to devour the world.",
  "滚球大战": "Ball battle",
  "国际口碑突破": "Breaking international reputation",
  "海外品牌重新建立": "Overseas brands are being reestablished",
