  "海外重新设计": "Overseas redesign",
  "海洋队与熔岩队在同一流程分别唤醒盖欧卡和固拉多，玩家不再只击败本版反派，而要由烈空坐中断两只传说宝可梦的失控对峙。战斗开拓区再以租借、随机指令、连续赛、属性倾向等七套规则复用同一战斗底层，让已经完成的队伍在不同信息条件下重新接受检验。": "The Ocean and Lava teams awaken Kyogre and Groudon respectively in the same process. Players no longer only defeat the villains of this edition but must interrupt the out-of-control standoff between the two legendary Pokémon through Thunder Seat. The Battle Expansion Zone then reuses seven sets of rules such as rental, random commands, consecutive matches, and type tendencies, allowing teams that have completed the battle to be tested again under different information conditions.",
