  "合并后首作": "First work after the merger",
  "合集分别重述特瑞寻找姐姐，以及伊尔／鲁卡拯救玛鲁塔岛的两段故事。": "The collection retells two stories: Terry's search for his sister and Il/Ruka's rescue of Maruta Island.",
  "合集依次重述洛特后裔讨伐龙王，以及三位后裔联手阻止哈贡的两段故事。": "The collection sequentially retells two stories of the Lotte descendants defeating the Dragon King, and the three descendants joining forces to stop Hagon.",
  "合金弹头：第二任务": "Metal Bullet: Second mission",
  "合金弹头：第一任务": "Metal Slug: First mission",
  "合金装备 幽灵通天塔": "Metal Gear Ghost Tower of Babel",
  "合作或背叛会同时改变双方点数，达到九点者可逃、归零者死亡；同一角色会因掌握信息不同作出相反选择。流程图允许玩家回到任意已见节点，路线锁则把“去别的世界取得口令”变成明确任务。": "Cooperation or betrayal will simultaneously change both parties' points: those who reach nine can escape, those who reset to zero die; The same character will make opposite choices depending on the information they possess. The flowchart allows players to return to any visible node, while route locks turn \"obtaining passwords from other worlds\" into explicit tasks.",
  "核心故事未改，但同伴对话和新婚姻选择让原本留白的人生阶段获得更密集的家庭视角。": "The core story remains unchanged, but peer dialogues and new marriage choices give the previously blank stages of life a more intense family perspective.",
  "核心仍是《火红》的探索、培养和对战，但通过改写地图、训练家与剧情顺序提供熟悉框架中的新挑战。": "The core remains exploration, development, and combat in \"Fiery Red,\" but new challenges within familiar frameworks are offered through rewritten maps, trainers, and story sequences.",
  "核心仍是关都收集与道馆成长，但皮卡丘始终在场景中回应玩家，使推进地图之外又多了一条观察伙伴情绪和关系变化的反馈线。": "The core remains collecting in stages and growing in gyms, but Pikachu always responds to players in the scene, adding a feedback line beyond the progression map to observe changes in companion emotions and relationships.",
  "核心仍是卡组组合和必杀联动，但家用进度以软件内赛事与收集替代每局出卡；价值来自规则保存和练习环境。": "The core remains deck combinations and ultimate synergies, but for home progress, each game is replaced by in-app events and collections; Value comes from the rules of preservation and the practice environment.",
  "核心仍是两作原有的捕获与配种；合集价值来自统一平台、画面和资料管理。它没有建立新的底层构筑规则。": "The core remains the original capture and breeding methods of both crops; The value of the collection comes from a unified platform, visuals, and data management. It does not establish new foundational construction rules.",
  "核心仍是钥匙世界、四格队伍和合成；倍速与自动周回缩短素材积累，新增怪物扩大终盘组合。它改变的是时间成本，不是基础胜负条件。": "The core remains Key World, four-tile teams, and crafting; Speed acceleration and auto-rotation shorten material accumulation, and new monsters expand endgame combinations. What changes is the time cost, not the fundamental winning or losing conditions.",
  "核心体验集中在单一高密度城市中的区域探索、捕捉和实时战斗，而不是跨越多个自然地区。": "The core experience focuses on area exploration, capture, and real-time combat within a single high-density city, rather than spanning multiple natural regions.",
