  "横竖屏双向操作设计，低价低功耗，主要面向日本市场。": "Dual-direction horizontal and vertical screen operation, low price and low power consumption, mainly targeting the Japanese market.",
  "红白机，手柄固定在机身。": "Famicom, with the handle fixed to the body.",
  "宏大救世叙事被拆成大量地方悲剧，玩家通过回访现代亲眼验证选择与时间的后果。": "The grand narrative of salvation is broken down into numerous local tragedies, and players experience the consequences of choices and time firsthand by revisiting the present day.",
  "后半案件通过分阶段读者挑战控制搜索空间：只有先证明前置事实，后续问题和组合才有意义。系统继续依赖有限关键词，因此难度主要来自信息筛选与组合顺序，而不是自由输入。": "The latter half of the case challenges readers in stages to control the search space: only by first proving the preceding facts do subsequent questions and combinations make sense. The system continues to rely on limited keywords, so the main difficulty lies in information filtering and combination order rather than free input.",
  "后更名 Channel F。": "It was later renamed Channel F.",
