  "后日谈把原作中服务主线的梅莉亚改为叙事中心，不再依靠未来视系统，而以政治修复、族群创伤和个人责任补完胜利之后仍未自动解决的问题。": "The epilogue shifts Merlia, who served the main storyline from the original, into a narrative center, no longer relying on the Vision system, but instead using political repair, ethnic trauma, and personal responsibility to address issues that remain unresolved after victory.",
  "后续系列": "Follow-up series",
