  "灰砖机，4 色灰阶屏。": "Gray brick machine, 4-color grayscale screen.",
  "恢复初代 CPU，主要变化是外观配色。": "The original CPU has been restored, with the main change being the exterior color scheme.",
  "挥剑方向匹配敌人弱点，盾牌输入承担防御，蓄积能量释放必杀；关卡必须让传感器可识别动作而非追求自由剑术。": "The direction of the sword swing matches the enemy's weak points, shield input takes on defense, energy is charged to release a finishing move; Levels must allow sensors to recognize actions rather than chasing free swordsmanship.",
  "回到《弟切草》的恐怖主干，以高清真人影像、语音和环绕声测试高规格 Sound Novel。": "Back to the horror core of Otogirisō, testing high-quality Sound Novels with high-definition live-action footage, voice, and surround sound.",
  "毁灭公爵3D": "Duke Ruins 3D",
  "绘制配种血统与技能继承，检查稀有组合怎样被线索、父母等级和重复培养共同控制。": "Map breeding pedigrees and skill inheritance, and check how rare combinations are jointly controlled by clues, parent levels, and repeated training.",
  "绘制石板线索、过去事件与现代结果三层图，研究长流程中单元剧如何维持宏观目标。": "Draw a three-layer diagram of slate clues, past events, and modern outcomes to study how episodic dramas maintain macro goals in a long process.",
  "魂斗罗 铁血兵团": "Contra: Ironblood Legion",
  "混合主机路线确立者": "Established the hybrid console route",
  "火焰之纹章 风花雪月": "Flame Emblem: Wind, Flowers, Snow, and Moon",
  "火焰之纹章 觉醒": "Fire Emblem: Awakened",
  "伙伴幕间把原版刻意留白的离散时期变成可操作视角，但也改变了玩家与勇者同时未知的叙事效果。": "The companion interlude turns the original deliberately blank discrete period into an operable perspective, but also changes the narrative effect of players and heroes being unknown at the same time.",
  "伙伴寻找本身就是叙事推进，队伍成立过程与系统复杂度同步增长。": "Finding partners is itself a narrative advancement, and the process of forming the team increases in sync with the complexity of the system.",
  "获得 Square 支持，但受到 GBA 压制": "Received support from Square but was suppressed by the GBA",
  "击败怪群积累 Smash 资源，随机祝福改变本局技能和属性，角色切换用于处理射程与冷却；装备抽取、素材和账号等级提供永久成长。两套成长的边界决定 Roguelite 是否仍有现场决策。": "Defeat hordes to accumulate Smash resources, randomly bless to change skills and types for the game, and switch characters to manage range and cooldown; Gear gacha, materials, and account levels provide permanent growth. Two sets of growth boundaries determine whether Roguelite still has on-the-ground decisions.",
  "机器人大战：2084": "Robot Wars: 2084",
  "机身更薄，屏幕更清晰。": "The body is thinner, and the screen is clearer.",
  "机身更小，接口调整。": "The body is smaller and the ports are adjusted.",
  "机身设计调整。": "Body design adjustments.",
  "机神兵袭击殖民地后，修尔克凭借能够预见未来的蒙纳多踏上复仇旅程。他逐渐发现巨神与机神的战争、同伴菲奥伦的存续以及世界创造者赞扎之间的真相，最终拒绝由神预先决定的未来，让众生选择自己的道路。": "After the Mecha God Soldiers attacked the colony, Shulk embarked on a journey of revenge, relying on his foresight of the future with Monaldo. He gradually uncovers the truth between the giant god and the machine god, the survival of his companion Fiorun, and the truth between the world's creator Zanza, ultimately rejecting a future predetermined by the gods and letting all beings choose their own path.",
  "基础判定仍由节奏准确度决定；任务组曲把多首歌、地图节点和首领串成连续资源消耗，对战则通过表现积累 Burst 干扰对手。长期目标从单曲通关扩展为曲库精通与队伍配置。": "Basic judgment is still determined by rhythm accuracy; The quest suite strung multiple songs, map nodes, and bosses into continuous resource consumption, while in battles, players accumulated Bursts to disrupt opponents. The long-term goal expanded from completing the main story to mastering the music library and team composition.",
  "基于 Final Fantasy（1987）的全新诠释": "A fresh interpretation based on Final Fantasy (1987).",
  "基于《火红》的地区与角色框架扩展剧情、地图和挑战内容；不同发行版的具体故事改动需以对应版本资料核对。": "Expanding the storyline, maps, and challenges based on the region and character framework of \"Fiery Red\"; Specific story changes in different releases must be verified against the corresponding version information.",
  "基于《火红》引擎重排地图、训练家和事件；不同版次的机制改动差异较大，需以作者说明和具体 ROM 版本为准。": "Rearrange maps, trainers, and events based on the Red engine; There are significant differences in mechanics changes across different editions; please refer to the author's notes and the specific ROM version for the final reference.",
  "极限竞速 地平线4": "Forza Horizon 4",
