  "面向儿童教育和绘本交互的硬件，模拟器数据库通常作为独立 Sega PICO 系统处理。": "For hardware aimed at children's education and picture book interaction, the simulator database is usually handled as a standalone Sega PICO system.",
  "面向儿童与动画 IP 的 FMV 互动主机，软件多围绕角色授权。": "FMV interactive consoles for children and animation IPs, with software mostly centered around character licensing.",
