  "面向增强画质和性能的中期升级。": "Mid-term upgrades aimed at enhancing image quality and performance.",
  "苗木诚与十五名超高校级学生被黑白熊囚禁在希望峰学园，只有杀人且不被同伴识破者才能毕业；众人逐案揭开学园与世界的真相。": "Makoto Naegi and fifteen super-high school students are imprisoned by Black and White Bear at Hope Peak Academy. Only those who kill and are not discovered by their companions can graduate; Together, they uncover the truth about the academy and the world case by case.",
  "苗木困被困在遭黑白熊占领的塔和市，与腐川冬子一同逃亡，并面对以大人为猎物的希望战士。": "Naegi Kon is trapped in Tawa City, which is occupied by Black and White Bear, and escapes with Fuyuko Fugawa, facing the Hope Warriors who prey on adults.",
  "明确面向女童市场的日本家用机，内置彩色贴纸打印机，把角色装扮与实体输出结合为差异化卖点。": "A Japanese home console aimed specifically at the girls' market, featuring a built-in color sticker printer that combines character costumes with physical output as a differentiated selling point.",
  "摸摸瓦力欧制造": "Touch-and-make Wario",
  "模拟摇杆与本地多人关键，卡带策略影响第三方": "Simulated joystick and local multiplayer are key, and cartridge strategies influence third parties",
  "魔兵驚天錄2": "Demon Soldier Shocking Chronicles 2",
  "魔法既是战斗消耗品，也是挂接到 HP、力量等属性的数值材料；库存越多，挂接收益通常越高。召唤兽决定可挂接项目并学习精制能力，敌人又随平均等级成长，因此有效成长依赖卡片、精制和挂接规划，而非只刷等级。": "Magic is both a consumable in battle and a numerical material attached to HP, Strength, and other types; The more inventory there is, the higher the revenue from the link. Summon decides to connect items and learn refinement abilities, and enemies grow with average level, so effective growth depends on cards, refinement, and linkage planning, not just leveling.",
  "魔幻弹珠台": "Magic pinball machine",
  "魔界塔士 沙加": "Demon World Tower Saga",
  "魔晶石占用武器与防具插槽，通过 AP 升级，并可在连结槽中组成“魔法＋全体化”“指令＋反击”等关系。装备成长、角色数值和技能组合共用有限槽位，玩家必须在即时属性、魔晶石培养速度和联动效果之间取舍。": "Materia occupies weapon and armor slots, upgrades through AP, and can form relationships like \"Magic + Universal\" or \"Command + Counter\" within the chain slot. Equipment growth, character stats, and skill combinations share limited slots, forcing players to choose between instant type, Materia training speed, and synergy effects.",
  "魔物獵人攜帶版3rd": "Monster Hunter Portable 3rd Edition",
  "末日宗教国家的教主遭肢解后被暂时复活，只剩四天寿命；主角必须从五名部长中找出凶手，完成神的试炼并恢复真正生命。": "The leader of the apocalyptic religious nation was dismembered and temporarily resurrected, with only four days left to live; The protagonist must identify the killer among the five ministers, complete the divine trial, and restore true life.",
  "莫比乌斯 最终幻想": "Moebius Final Fantasy",
  "莫古受两位神托付，召集历代英雄关闭扭曲时空的裂隙；众人在失去或恢复记忆的过程中对抗利用世界意志的敌人。": "Mogu, entrusted by two gods, summoned heroes from past generations to close the rift that twisted space-time; The group fights enemies who manipulate the will of the world as they lose or recover their memories.",
  "莫罗与艾茉在跨越时代的旅程中收集召唤兽力量，阻止世界毁灭，并逐步揭开同伴与时间线的真相。": "Moro and Amor, on their journey across eras, gather summon powers to prevent the destruction of the world and gradually uncover the truth behind their companions and timeline.",
  "母子与王国诅咒为挥剑关卡提供连续目标，叙事结构本身较传统。": "Mother and Son and Kingdom Curse provide continuous objectives for the sword-wielding stage, and the narrative structure itself is quite traditional.",
  "脑航员2": "Brain Navigator 2",
  "内置 PS2 的 Bravia 电视。": "Bravia TV with built-in PS2.",
