  "强化版补充被删除的剧情片段、追加配音语言和在线合作，但不重新设计原作主线与核心经济循环。": "Enhanced Edition supplements deleted story scenes, adds voice acting language, and online collaborations, but does not redesign the original main storyline or core economic cycle.",
  "强化史莱姆作为可操作主角的动作语言，让冲撞、搬运与载具成为区别于正传的稳定分支身份。": "Strengthen Slime's action language as the playable protagonist, making charges, carries, and vehicles stable branches distinct from mainline games.",
  "墙、门、光源和家具满足条件会被识别成房间并触发居民功能；章节据点提供生产与防守，远征提供材料。建造不是装饰，而是可被系统读取的功能配置。": "Walls, doors, light sources, and furniture that meet certain conditions will be recognized as rooms and trigger resident functions; Chapter outposts provide production and defense, expeditions provide materials. Construction is not decoration, but functional configurations that can be read by the system.",
  "轻薄改版": "A lighter and lighter redesign",
  "求生之路2": "The Road to Survival 2",
  "区分随机 Blessing 带来的局内构筑和抽取装备带来的局外强度，检查失败原因是否能被玩家清楚归因。": "Distinguish between in-game builds from random Blessings and metagame strength from gacha gear, and check whether the failure can be clearly attributed by players.",
  "区分原作改编与原创线，检查三线战斗是否真正要求换位，及停服后原创内容的保存问题。": "Distinguish between original adaptations and original lines, check whether the third-line battles truly require a replacement, and the preservation of original content after shutdown.",
