  "软件没有统一的 RPG 循环，而以模块化入口承载不同目的：XenoComi 用选择和阅读补角色，XenoPittan 把系列词汇变成拼字资源，百科负责检索，试玩版负责向 Episode II 转化。其底层逻辑是让同一批设定资产同时服务叙事、复习与推广。": "The software does not have a unified RPG loop but uses modular entry points to serve different purposes: XenoComi fills characters with selection and reading, XenoPittan turns vocabulary into spelling resources, Baike handles searching, and demos convert to Episode II. The underlying logic is to have the same batch of set assets simultaneously serve narrative, review, and promotion.",
  "软件数量少，但推动可替换掌机游戏形态": "There are fewer software options, but they promote the replaceable handheld gaming form",
  "弱化传统配种，加入旅团口粮、人类职业与怪物之心，把养成重心从血统转向旅行编制。": "Weaken traditional breeding, add group rations, human jobs, and monster hearts, shifting progression's focus from bloodline to travel organization.",
