  "尚未找到足以支持“行业级外部影响”结论的可靠资料。超级进化带来版本限定的临时强化机制与广泛对战讨论，但不据此断言影响了其他系列。": "Reliable evidence has not yet been found to support the conclusion of \"industry-level external impact.\" Mega Evolution brings patch-exclusive temporary buffs and broad gameplay discussions, but doesn't claim to have affected other sets.",
  "尚未找到足以支持“行业级外部影响”结论的可靠资料。官方确认其为系列首批完全开放世界 RPG；这说明系列路线变化，不等同于已经影响其他开放世界作品。": "Reliable evidence has not yet been found to support the conclusion of \"industry-level external impact.\" Officially confirmed as one of the first fully open-world RPGs in the series; This indicates that the series' direction has changed and does not mean it has already influenced other open world titles.",
  "尚未找到足以支持“行业级外部影响”结论的可靠资料。官方确认特性与双打扩展了本作策略深度，但这一证据仅支持系列内部影响，不能延伸为行业级结论。": "Reliable evidence has not yet been found to support the conclusion of \"industry-level external impact.\" The official confirmation that Ability and Doubles expand the strategic depth of the game, but this evidence only supports internal series influences and cannot be extended to industry-level conclusions.",
  "尚未找到足以支持“行业级外部影响”结论的可靠资料。扩展票替代传统第三版本是系列商业与内容模式的转折，但尚无可靠资料证明其外溢到行业层面。": "Reliable evidence has not yet been found to support the conclusion of \"industry-level external impact.\" The replacement of the traditional third version with the expansion ticket marks a turning point in the series' commercial and content model, but there is no reliable evidence that it has spilled over into the industry.",
