  "椭圆按钮外观。": "Elliptical button appearance.",
  "瓦恩在达尔马斯卡王国沦陷后卷入阿雪公主的复国行动，与巴修、巴夫雷亚等人对抗阿尔卡迪亚帝国和操纵历史的神明。": "After the fall of the Kingdom of Dalmaska, Vaan becomes involved in Princess Ashe's restoration efforts, fighting against the Arcadian Empire and the gods who manipulate history alongside Bashu, Bafrea, and others.",
  "瓦力欧制造": "Wario Manufacturing",
  "瓦利歐樂園2 被盜的財寶": "Wario Land 2: The stolen treasure",
  "瓦利歐樂園3 不可思議的音樂盒": "Wario Land 3: The Incredible Music Box",
