  "银河队在枪之柱引发危机，骑拉帝纳将主角带入反转世界；主角在异质空间中追击赤日并阻止新宇宙计划。": "The Galactic Team causes a crisis at the Pillar of Spears, while Giratina brings the protagonist into a twisted world; The protagonist chases Chiri through a heterogeneous space and thwarts the new cosmic plan.",
