  "引入秋山、冴岛和谷村，并证明正传可暂时离开桐生单主角结构。秋山与冴岛此后持续参与系列，四人接力的章节模型也被《5》的五主角结构和《8》的双主角分线重新采用。": "Introducing Akiyama, Saejima, and Tanimura proves that the mainline game can temporarily leave Kiryu's single-protagonist structure. Akiyama and Saejima continued to participate in the series, and the four-person relay chapter model was readopted by the five-protagonist structure from \"5\" and the dual-protagonist storyline from \"8.\"",
  "隐姓埋名的宫本武藏在京都祇园以保镖身份生活，一名少女请求他刺杀“宫本武藏”。追查让他卷入德川政权、吉野太夫与旧日同伴之间的阴谋。": "Miyamoto Musashi, who lived under an assumed identity as a bodyguard in Gion, Kyoto, was begged by a young girl to assassinate 'Miyamoto Musashi.' The investigation drew him into a conspiracy between the Tokugawa regime, Yoshino Dayū, and his old companions.",
  "应龙风格负责蓄力、抓取和重击，特工风格用蛛丝牵引、喷射鞋与无人机控制群体。两套风格分别对应桐生旧身份与新伪装，使角色冲突直接表现为操作切换。": "The Yinglong style is responsible for charging, grabbing, and heavy attacks, while the Agent style uses spider silk traction, jet shoes, and drones to control the group. These two styles correspond to Kiryu's old identity and new disguise, making character conflicts directly manifest as switching between actions.",
  "英雄集结": "Heroes assemble",
  "英雄集结 · 动作 RPG": "Heroes Assemble · Action RPG",
  "英雄为保护故乡 Valdecia，对抗从异次元涌出的怪物，并在持续章节中集结伙伴。": "To protect their homeland of Valdecia, heroes fight monsters emerging from another dimension and gather companions throughout the ongoing chapters.",
  "硬件能力有限，但拥有本土市场历史地位": "Limited hardware capabilities but a historic position in the local market",
