  "佣兵克劳德加入雪崩组织反抗神罗，追查萨菲罗斯毁灭星球的计划；在身份记忆崩解后重新确认自我，并与伙伴阻止陨石。": "Mercenary Cloud joins the Avalanche organization to resist Shinra, investigating Sephiroth's plan to destroy the planet; After his identity memories collapse, he reaffirms himself and his companions to stop the meteorite.",
  "拥有水晶能力的雷尔在莱尔提亚大陆调查水晶与族群冲突，阻止古代力量复苏带来的灾难。": "Rell, who possesses crystal powers, investigates the conflict between crystals and races on the continent of Laertia, trying to prevent the disaster brought by the revival of ancient power.",
