  "Paradigm Shift把职业配置提升为战斗中的高速指令：玩家预先编成六组职能组合，临场切换来改变全队行为，而非逐条输入命令。它推动正传继续向实时节奏与自动队友发展，并由《XIII-2》直接继承改良。": "Paradigm Shift elevates job configurations to high-speed commands in battle: players are pre-assigned into six functional groups and switch between them on the spot to change the team's behavior rather than entering commands individually. It pushed the mainline game to continue evolving toward real-time pacing and auto teammates, and was directly improved by XIII-2.",
