  "Sega 家用硬件起点": "Sega home hardware starting point",
  "SEGA 与 Sammy 于 2004 年 10 月 1 日完成经营整合并成立 SEGA SAMMY HOLDINGS；2005 年 12 月 8 日发行的初代《如龙》既是系列首作，也是本时间线在该集团结构下的第一部作品。这个标记说明系列诞生所处的公司治理阶段，不表示 Sammy 团队参与了《如龙》的具体设计或开发。": "SEGA and Sammy completed their business integration and established SEGA SAMMY HOLDINGS on October 1, 2004; The original Like a Dragon, released on December 8, 2005, was both the first entry in the series and the first entry under the group's timeline. This marker indicates the corporate governance stage in which the series was born and does not imply that the Sammy team was involved in the specific design or development of Like a Dragon.",
