  "Soul Shield 消耗 Break 槽格挡并夺取敌方技能，削空敌人 Break 后可处决回收 MP；装备亲和度又决定职业被动。玩家在高风险防御、MP 循环和即时换职之间建立攻防链。": "Soul Shield consumes Break slots to block and steal enemy skills; after emptying the enemy's Break, you can execute and recover MP; Equipment affinity determines job passivity. Players build a chain of offense and defense between high-risk defense, MP cycles, and instant class changes.",
  "Sound Novel 起点": "Sound Novel Starting Point",
  "Spike 分支 · 高速推理": "Spike branch · High-speed reasoning",
  "Spike 与 Chunsoft 于 2012 年 4 月合并成立 Spike Chunsoft；同年 7 月 26 日发售的《超级弹丸论破 2》是本时间线中第一款在合并后推出的作品。它延续的是原 Spike 的《弹丸论破》项目，因此这里标记的是组织归属变化，不表示两家公司原有叙事团队已经在本作中完成设计方法融合。": "Spike and Chunsoft merged to form Spike Chunsoft in April 2012; Super Danganronpa 2, released on July 26 of the same year, was the first title in this timeline to be released after the merge. It continues the original Spike Danganronpa project, so this marks an organizational change and does not mean the original narrative teams of both companies have completed the fusion of design methods in this game.",
  "Spike Chunsoft 2025 年《弹丸论破》系列全球累计出货 1,000 万套公告；系列多平台发行记录。": "Spike Chunsoft announces cumulative global shipments of 10 million sets of Danganronpa series in 2025; Series multi-platform release records.",
