  "Spike Chunsoft 公司沿革与公司介绍；《忌火起草》官方 Sound Novel 历史说明。": "Spike Chunsoft Company History and Company Introduction; Official Sound Novel History Overview of 'Drafting the Forbidden Fire'.",
