  "Spike Chunsoft《真恐怖惊魂夜》官方 Sound Novel 定义": "Spike Chunsoft's official definition of the Sound Novel for 'Kamaitachi no Yoru'",
  "Square 与 Enix 于 2003 年 4 月 1 日合并为 Square Enix；同年 8 月 8 日发行的 Final Fantasy Crystal Chronicles，是本时间线中合并完成后最先发售的 Final Fantasy 作品。这里标记的是作品发行时的公司归属节点；这个时间关系本身不代表原 Square 与原 Enix 的开发团队已在本作中共同设计。": "Square and Enix merged on April 1, 2003, to form Square Enix; Final Fantasy Crystal Chronicles, released on August 8 of the same year, was the first Final Fantasy title released after the Merge in this timeline. This marks the company ownership milestone at the time of publication; This timing relationship does not mean that the original Square and the original Enix development teams co-designed this game.",
  "Square 与 Enix 于 2003 年 4 月 1 日合并为 Square Enix；同年 9 月 19 日发行的 Kenshin Dragon Quest，是本时间线中合并完成后最先发售的 Dragon Quest 作品。这里记录的是发行主体进入 Square Enix 时期，不表示原 Square 团队参与了本作设计，也不把它误写成两家公司共同开发的第一作。": "Square and Enix merged on April 1, 2003, to form Square Enix; Kenshin Dragon Quest, released on September 19 of the same year, was the first Dragon Quest title released after the merge in this timeline. This records indicate that the publisher entered the Square Enix era, but it does not mean the original Square team participated in the design of this game, nor does it mistakenly refer to it as the first jointly developed title by the two companies.",
  "Square Enix 2020 年《Dragon Quest XI》全球累计出货与下载销量突破 600 万的官方公告。": "Square Enix officially announced that in 2020, cumulative global shipments and downloads of Dragon Quest XI surpassed 6 million copies.",
