  "Square Enix 官方公司沿革与 2004 年年度报告确认合并生效日；Square Enix 官方产品页及 2003 年 7 月新闻稿确认本作于 2003 年 9 月 19 日发行。": "Square Enix official company history and the 2004 annual report confirm the effective date of the merger; The official Square Enix product page and the July 2003 press release confirmed that the game was released on September 19, 2003.",
