  "Vector 工程师 Shion 与战斗用人造人 KOS-MOS 在 Gnosis 袭击中卷入 Zohar Emulator 争夺，并与 Jr.、MOMO、Ziggy 等人会合。众人前往第二米尔奇亚时逐渐触及 U-TIC、Albedo 与旧米尔奇亚灾难，但更大的 U-DO 和 Wilhelm 计划仍未揭开。": "Vector engineer Shion and combat cyborg KOS-MOS get caught up in the Zohar Emulator fight during the Gnosis assault, and join forces with Jr., MOMO, Ziggy, and others. As they head to the second Milkia, they gradually encounter the U-TIC, Albedo, and old Mirkia disasters, but the larger U-DO and Wilhelm plans remain unveiled.",
