  "Xbox 平台战略转折点": "A strategic turning point for the Xbox platform",
  "Xbox 双机型生态世代": "Xbox dual-console ecosystem generation",
  "Xenoblade Chronicles 2 借助 Nintendo Switch 的全球用户基础显著扩大受众，销量超出团队对欧美市场的预期，并在当时成为销量最高的 Xeno 作品。它把前作积累的国际口碑转化为可持续的全球商业规模。": "Xenoblade Chronicles 2 leveraged the global user base of Nintendo Switch to significantly expand its audience, exceeding the team's expectations for the European and American markets, and became the best-selling Xeno title at the time. It transformed the international reputation accumulated by the previous game into a sustainable global commercial scale.",
  "Xenoblade Chronicles 以巨型世界、实时队伍战斗和完整叙事建立 Xenoblade 的系列身份。欧美玩家推动的 Operation Rainfall 让其北美本地化本身成为事件，海外发行后的口碑使 Xeno 创作谱系第一次获得持续国际关注。": "Xenoblade Chronicles establishes Xenoblade's series identity through a massive world, real-time team battles, and a complete narrative. Operation Rainfall, driven by Western players, made its North American localization itself an event, and the word-of-mouth after its overseas release brought sustained international attention to the Xeno creative lineage for the first time.",
  "XenoComi 以多名角色的轻喜剧短篇补充 Episode I 之后的船上生活与关系，其他模块则用术语库和小游戏回顾设定。本作没有推进三部曲的核心危机。": "XenoComi supplements life and relationships on the ship after Episode I with light comedy short stories featuring multiple characters, while other modules are set up with a glossary and mini-game retrospectives. This work does not advance the core crisis of the trilogy.",
  "Xenogears 在日本取得超过 50 万销量对应的 PlayStation Gold Prize，后续日本出货接近 91 万。它没有直接发展成同一版权下的续作，却让高桥哲哉围绕巨型机甲、宗教哲学与多层世界结构的创作方向获得足够认知，成为后来 Xenosaga 与 Xenoblade 的谱系起点。": "Xenogears achieved over 500,000 sales in Japan and won the PlayStation Gold Prize, with shipments in Japan approaching 910,000. It did not directly develop into Sequel under the same copyright, but it gave Tetsuya Takahashi sufficient recognition of his creative direction around giant mechs, religious philosophy, and multi-layered world structures, becoming the starting point for the later Xenosaga and Xenoblade lineages.",
